#. comic1 panel p2
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: raddstare.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic1.htm:107
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic1#p2.1"
msgid "Meet Radd, the hero of the game."
msgstr "Знакомьтесь: Улёт, герой игры."

