msgstr "Зашибись."

#. comic1 panel p4
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: raddrock.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic1.htm:217
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic1#p4.1"
msgid "Of course by \"cool,\" we mean by mid-1980's standards."
msgstr "Разумеется, «крутого» — по меркам середины восьмидесятых."

#. comic1 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: raddrock.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic1.htm:225
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic1#p4.2"
msgid "Air guitar! Woo!"
msgstr "Воздушная гитара! Ю-ху!"

#. comic2 panel title
