#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: raddwalk.gif, floor2walk.gif
#: kidradd/comic2.htm:182
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic2#p3.1"
msgid "Radd cannot do anything on his own; his every move is commanded by the player."
msgstr "Сам по себе Улёт ничего не может: каждое его движение — приказ игрока."

#. comic2 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: raddwalk.gif, floor2walk.gif
#: kidradd/comic2.htm:190
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic2#p3.2"
