#. comic4 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: flower.gif, raddmstare.gif, floor3.gif
#: kidradd/comic4.htm:247
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic4#p4.2"
msgid "Not for me!"
msgstr "Только не я!"

