#. comic10 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: raddfront.gif
#: kidradd/comic10.htm:239
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic10#p4.1"
msgid "Is time passing while I'm here? Am I still technically alive, or even conscious right now? If not, then why do I sense this place at all?"
